# Binary assets must never go through line-ending conversion.
# This repo has core.autocrlf=true; without these rules Git classifies the PDF as
# text and injects CR bytes into its binary streams on checkout, which corrupts
# its xref table (the PPTX and PNGs happen to be detected as binary already).
*.pdf    binary
*.pptx   binary
*.pbix   binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.gif    binary
*.ico    binary
*.xlsx   binary
*.docx   binary
*.zip    binary
